  "title": "Flowise unauthenticated OAuth2 token refresh endpoint leaks access tokens (CVE-2026-70478)",
  "summary": "Flowise 3.1.2 and earlier expose an unauthenticated OAuth2 token refresh endpoint that returns fresh access tokens for stored credentials, enabling token theft for any service connected to the instance. Fixed in 3.1.3.",
